'''Gingermint''' is a [[godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by giving 100 [[Gifts]] {{Currency|Old Gift}} (equivalent to a total of 100,000 [[Snow Tokens]] {{Currency|Snow Token}}) to players during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Trivia==
*It is the fifth [[Godly Weapons|godly]] weapon to be obtained from gifting, the others being [[Swirly Blade]], [[Jinglegun]], [[Lugercane]], and [[Evergun]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife under the name [[Cookiecane]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Cookie Set|Cookie Set]].
*Its model is fairly similiar to another same-themed godly gun with the name of [[Minty]].
*This gun gives a 10% better chance of becoming sheriff due to a small bug in the game.
*It costed 100,000 [[Snow Tokens]], which was more expensive than [[Gingerscope]] and [[Icepiercer]] despite being in a lower [[Value|tier]].

